      "q": "How much does Elbitamerica make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Elbitamerica obligated $358M in federal contracts in FY2026 to date. Elbitamerica received 178 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $2M. Obligations are up 359.5% year over year. Historical annual obligations were FY21 $115M, FY22 $119M, FY23 $96.8M, FY24 $137M, and FY25 $77.9M."
